#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: kbruch.appdata.xml:6
msgid "KBruch"
msgstr "KBruch"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: kbruch.appdata.xml:7
msgid "Exercise Fractions"
msgstr "Vježba razlomaka"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: kbruch.appdata.xml:9
msgid ""
"KBruch is a small program to practice calculating with fractions and "
"percentages. Different exercises are provided for this purpose and you can "
"use the learning mode to practice with fractions. The program checks the "
"user's input and gives feedback."
msgstr ""
"KBruch je mali program da vježbate računanje sa razlomcima i procentima. "
"Različite vježbe su obezbjeđeni za tu svrhu i možete koristiti režim učenja "
"da vježbate sa razlomcima. Program provjerava ulaz korisnika i daje povratnu "
"informaciju."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: kbruch.appdata.xml:10
msgid "Features:"
msgstr "Svojstva:"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: kbruch.appdata.xml:12
msgid ""
"Arithmetic exercise - in this exercise you have to solve a given fraction "
"task. You have to enter the numerator and the denominator. This is the main "
"exercise."
msgstr ""
"Aritmetička vježba - u ovoj vježbi morate riješiti dati razlomak . Morate "
"ući u brojnik i nazivnik. Ovo je glavna vježba."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: kbruch.appdata.xml:13
msgid ""
"Comparison exercise - in this exercise you have to compare the size of 2 "
"given fractions, using the symbols &gt;, &lt; or =."
msgstr ""
"Vježba poređenja - u ovoj vježbi morate porediti 2 data razlomkas, koristeći "
"simbole &gt;, &lt; ili =."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: kbruch.appdata.xml:14
msgid ""
"Conversion exercise - in this exercise you have to convert a given number "
"into a fraction."
msgstr ""
"Konverzija vježbe - u ovoj vježbi morate pretvoriti dati broj u razlomak."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: kbruch.appdata.xml:15
msgid ""
"Factorization exercise - in this exercise you have to factorize a given "
"number into its prime factors."
msgstr ""
"Faktorizacijska vježba - u ovoj vježbi morate razložiti dati broj na proste "
"faktore."

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: kbruch.appdata.xml:16
msgid ""
"Percentage exercise - in this exercise you have to calculate percentages."
msgstr "Procenat vježbe - u ovoj vježbi morate izračunati postotke."
